---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Playground" description="A public sample SSF Transmitter and Receiver for testing your own Shared Signals implementation. Coming soon.">
  <p class="eyebrow">Playground · coming soon</p>
  <h1>Test against a live Transmitter and Receiver</h1>
  <p class="lede">A public, standards-conformant sample Transmitter and Receiver, so you can test your implementation without
  needing a partner on the other end.</p>

  <div class="grid" style="margin:2rem 0">
    <div class="card">
      <span class="tags"><span class="tag ssf">Transmitter</span></span>
      <h3>Sample Transmitter</h3>
      <p>Discovery at <code>/.well-known/ssf-configuration</code>, full stream management, push and poll delivery,
      verification — and a UI to fire any CAEP or RISC event at your stream.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <span class="tags"><span class="tag caep">Receiver</span></span>
      <h3>Sample Receiver</h3>
      <p>Point your Transmitter at it and watch your SETs arrive, decoded and validated, with clear errors when
      a signature, <code>iss</code>, <code>aud</code> or <code>typ</code> is wrong.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <span class="tags"><span class="tag neutral">Tools</span></span>
      <h3>SET inspector</h3>
      <p>Paste a SET to decode it, check it against the event schema and verify it with a JWKS URL.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="prose">
    <h2>Planned endpoints</h2>
    <p>These paths are reserved on this domain and will go live with the playground:</p>
    <div class="table-wrap"><table>
      <thead><tr><th>Path</th><th>Purpose</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td><code>/.well-known/ssf-configuration</code></td><td>Transmitter Configuration Metadata</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>/ssf/stream</code>, <code>/ssf/status</code>, <code>/ssf/subjects:add</code>, <code>/ssf/subjects:remove</code>, <code>/ssf/verify</code></td><td>Stream management</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>/ssf/poll/…</code></td><td>Poll delivery (RFC 8936)</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>/ssf/push/…</code></td><td>Sample Receiver push endpoint (RFC 8935)</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table></div>
    <p>In the meantime, <a href="https://caep.dev/">caep.dev</a> offers a public test service.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
